* CABSRT13 - EDI INTERCHANGE FILTER
* SELECTS THE SEGMENTS THAT BELONG TO TONIGHT'S INTERCHANGE.  THE
* LIST OF TRADING PARTNERS IN THE INTERCHANGE IS THE INCLUDE
* CONDITION BELOW AND IS MAINTAINED BY HAND.  CABFMT06 WRITES
* SEGMENTS FOR EVERY CARRIER AND HAS NO IDEA THAT MOST OF THEM
* ARE DISCARDED HERE.
*
* WHEN A NEW PARTNER GOES LIVE THIS CARD IS THE ONLY THING THAT
* HAS TO CHANGE.  WHEN A PARTNER IS REMOVED AND THIS CARD IS NOT
* UPDATED THEIR SEGMENTS GO OUT ANYWAY.
 SORT FIELDS=COPY
 INCLUDE COND=((9,4,CH,EQ,C'0288'),OR,(9,4,CH,EQ,C'6006'),OR,
               (9,4,CH,EQ,C'9104'),OR,(9,4,CH,EQ,C'2214'))
 RECORD TYPE=F,LENGTH=200
